<http://data.silknow.org/object/95527279-226e-318f-88ca-0c3d592ed378/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Composed of three parts. A red cotton waistband joined to a strip of  acheik (horizontal wave patterned) silk textile in coral, white, yellow and lime on a dark blue ground to which is attached a separately woven silk train of two pieces sewn together worked with a pattern of narrow stripes in the same colours of  the central panel on a dark purple and white ground. The components are handstitched together and lined with white cotton muslin."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/95527279-226e-318f-88ca-0c3d592ed378> .

